<Layout title="Technology & design — movement, controls and construction" description="Explore model-specific movement, LCD displays, charging connections and product construction across the BOHOL personal wellness collection.">
 <section class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">TECHNOLOGY & DESIGN</p><h1>Understand<br/>the difference.</h1><p>Look at the mechanisms, controls and construction behind each product. Features vary by model; the details matter.</p></section>
 <section class="tech-story" id="motion"><div class="tech-photo"><img src="/images/twist-hero.webp" width="800" height="800" alt="Twist & Fun device with a visible inner window" loading="lazy"/></div><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / MOVEMENT</p><h2>More than<br/>one motion.</h2><p>Twist & Fun combines twisting and telescopic movement. Starship takes an open-form approach, with nine rotation settings and nine vibration settings listed in its product sheet.</p><p>Mode counts describe selectable settings, not a universal performance score. Compare the movement type and the product construction together.</p><div class="tech-facts"><div><strong>Twist & Fun</strong><span>Twisting + telescopic motion</span></div><div><strong>Starship</strong><span>Rotation + vibration settings</span></div></div><a class="text-link" href="/journal/twist-fun-vs-starship/">Compare the two designs <Icon name="arrow-up-right"/></a></div></section>
 <section class="tech-story" id="controls"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / THE INTERFACE</p><h2>Keep the<br/>controls in view.</h2><p>Twist & Fun uses an LCD panel above its exterior buttons. CJ7 frames its digital controls with a green accent, while Space uses a circular display at the top of its cylindrical body.</p><p>Display layout, mode indication and button behavior differ. The guide supplied with your device is the reference for operating it.</p><a class="text-link" href="/journal/displays-and-controls/">A guide to controls <Icon name="arrow-up-right"/></a></div><div class="tech-photo"><img src="/images/cj7-front.webp" width="800" height="800" alt="CJ7 green-accented control panel" loading="lazy"/></div></section>
 <section class="tech-story" id="construction"><div class="tech-photo"><img src="/images/mengqu-hero.webp" width="800" height="800" alt="Mengqu device on its matching stand" loading="lazy"/></div><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / CONSTRUCTION</p><h2>A form for<br/>every design.</h2><p>Construction changes how a device is held, stored and viewed. Starship exposes its inner shape through an open body. Mengqu uses a compact silhouette with a matching stand. Bite includes a protective cover.</p><p>Material combinations are model-specific. The published Twist & Fun specification lists ABS and TPE, while Mengqu lists ABS and silicone.</p><a class="text-link" href="/products/">Explore the constructions <Icon name="arrow-up-right"/></a></div></section>
 <section class="tech-story" id="charging"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / CHARGING & CONNECTIVITY</p><h2>Match the<br/>exact model.</h2><p>Twist & Fun, CJ7 and Space list USB-C charging. Starship lists a DC socket. A shared connector shape is not enough to determine the required power supply.</p><p>App features also depend on the product and region. Check the exact model’s documentation before relying on a particular connection or remote-control function.</p><a class="text-link" href="/journal/charging-connections/">Read the charging guide <Icon name="arrow-up-right"/></a></div><div class="tech-photo"><img src="/images/starship-back.webp" width="800" height="800" alt="Starship exterior and rear construction" loading="lazy"/></div></section>
 <section class="tech-story" id="rd-center"><div class="tech-photo"><img src="/images/hq-rd-office.webp" width="1024" height="768" alt="BOHOL R&D Engineering and Design Center" loading="lazy"/></div><div><p class="eyebrow">05 / IN-HOUSE R&D STUDIO</p><h2>30+ Engineers.<br/>Zero Middlemen.</h2><p>Our dedicated engineering center unites mechanical engineers, industrial designers, acoustic researchers, and firmware specialists working directly on proprietary drive mechanics.</p><p>Equipped with advanced CAD/CAM software, kinematics simulation, and SLA/SLS 3D printing—delivering functional test prototypes in 7 days.</p><div class="tech-facts"><div><strong>R&D Staff</strong><span>30+ Senior Engineers</span></div><div><strong>Turnaround</strong><span>7-Day Rapid Prototyping</span></div></div><a class="text-link" href="/partners/">Discuss Custom Engineering <Icon name="arrow-up-right"/></a></div></section>
 <section class="tech-story" id="collaboration"><div><p class="eyebrow">06 / PRIVATE-LABEL SUITES</p><h2>Confidential<br/>Project Strategy.</h2><p>Our executive technical suites host confidential private-mold reviews, IP patent clearance analyses, and bilateral NDA contract signing with international distributors and brand owners.</p><p>Every private-label project receives dedicated project managers, ensuring seamless progression from CAD drafts to mass cleanroom production.</p><div class="tech-facts"><div><strong>Patents</strong><span>40+ Utility & Design</span></div><div><strong>Lead Time</strong><span>15-Day Production</span></div></div><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Schedule a Design Review <Icon name="arrow-up-right"/></a></div><div class="tech-photo"><img src="/images/hq-boardroom.webp" width="1024" height="768" alt="BOHOL Executive OEM Strategy Boardroom" loading="lazy"/></div></section>
